01:12:02.210 --> 01:12:02.370
<v Marc>Ja.

01:12:03.090 --> 01:12:03.810
<v Marc>Nee, es sind schon 10.

01:12:03.890 --> 01:12:04.450
<v Marc>Oh, 10 schon.

01:12:04.850 --> 01:12:05.330
<v Marc>So schnell geht's.

01:12:05.490 --> 01:12:06.770
